ning to ski was not easy. My lesson focused on the basics. Here's some advice.", "id": 2, "time": "14300", "image": ""}, {"text": "Fasten the ski boots tightly.  Don't forget to use goggles and gloves. Put on the skis carefully. When skiing, use your poles to keep your balance. The only thing I didn't learn was how to slow down or stop.", "id": 3, "time": "26300", "image": ""}, {"text": "Oops!  Watch out, people below me! I'm above you and I can't stop!  Next time, I'm going to take more than one lesson!", "id": 4, "time": "40500", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn4le04ob11re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}]}]}